{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1135758-rebirth-ritual","id":1135758,"title":"Rebirth Ritual","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-31T07:12:40-07:00","id":1135758,"title":"Rebirth Ritual","content":"I was wondering if two deities were willing could they take part in ritual to Rebirth a demigod or hero Scion as what I believe Neall called in a post somewhere as Godborn? Long-winded question I know but the idea came from Scion 2.0s Fertility Boon, Fruitful Union. As a rite of passage it could be performed like an adoption ritual to make a favored Scion a Deity without all the blood, sweat, and gore. It would have to be a reward for some kind of service of extraordinary nature. Does this idea seem plausable? I imagine the two divinities involved as the parents would have to assume responsibitly while the new Deity explored it's options and powers though. Does this idea seem plausible to any of you?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13647-manannansun","name":"Manannansun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-31T09:26:36-07:00","id":1135810,"title":"","content":"If my understanding is correct i think an accomplishment like that is required to graduate a demigod to godhood (think heracles 12 labours). I don't think there is a quick way to increase legend ratings, otherwise gods would draft their kids into deities anytime something threatened the pantheon.<br /> <br /> Though a rumor of an artifact or god capable of bestowing godhood on anyone could make a good plot","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3729,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3729-darkfoxd